**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Bb]uild/
**/[Bb]uilds/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
**/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
**/[Uu]pmCache/
**/Assets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
**/Assets/AssetStoreTools*

